---
import Layout from "../layout/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Becas y Correo Institucional">
    <section class="bg-linear-to-br from-slate-50 to-gray-100 py-16 px-4 relative overflow-hidden min-h-screen">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-3">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-72 h-72 bg-blue-100 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl opacity-30 animate-pulse-slow"></div>
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 bg-green-100 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl opacity-30 animate-pulse-slow animation-delay-2000"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 w-72 h-72 bg-cyan-100 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl opacity-30 animate-pulse-slow animation-delay-4000"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <div class="inline-block">
                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-linear-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg mx-auto mb-4">
                            <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"></path>
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"></path>
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14v6l9-5m-9 5l-9-5m9 5l9-5"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">
                        Beca Estudiantil y <br>
                        <span class="bg-linear-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
                            Correo Institucional
                        </span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                        Guía completa para solicitar tu beca y aprovechar los beneficios de tu correo estudiantil UNET
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group hover:border-blue-200 flex flex-col min-h-[420px]">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-linear-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Solicitar beca estudiantil</h2>
                            <p class="text-green-600 font-medium">Proceso paso a paso</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-6 grow">
                        <!-- Paso 1 -->
                        <div class="flex gap-4">
                            <div class="shrink-0">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-green-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm">
                                    1
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="grow">
                                <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Reunir documentos requeridos</h3>
                                <div class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span>Fotocopia de la cédula de identidad</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span>2 números de teléfonos personales</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span>Información de la carrera que cursas</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span>Cuenta bancaria propia</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span>Cuenta en la plataforma patria activa</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex gap-4">
                            <div class="shrink-0">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-green-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm">
                                    2
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="grow">
                                <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Entrega en coordinación</h3>
                                <p class="text-gray-600">
                                    Llevar todos los documentos a la Coordinación Estudiantil de la UNET
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-auto pt-6">
                        <div class="p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-xl border border-green-200">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-green-400 rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
                                <span class="text-green-700 font-medium">Proceso activo - Disponible para todos los estudiantes</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group hover:border-blue-200 flex flex-col min-h-[420px]">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-linear-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Correo institucional</h2>
                            <p class="text-blue-600 font-medium">Beneficios y activación</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-6 grow">
                        <div class="flex gap-4">
                            <div class="shrink-0">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm">
                                    1
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="grow">
                                <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Activar correo UNET</h3>
                                <p class="text-gray-600">
                                    Activa tu correo institucional proporcionado por la universidad
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex gap-4">
                            <div class="shrink-0">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm">
                                    2
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="grow">
                                <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Acceder a beneficios</h3>
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600">
                                        <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span class="text-sm">Spotify Student</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600">
                                        <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span class="text-sm">GitHub Student</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600">
                                        <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span class="text-sm">Notion Pro</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600">
                                        <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span class="text-sm">Canva Pro</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600">
                                        <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span class="text-sm">Adobe Creative</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600">
                                        <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span class="text-sm">Autodesk</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600">
                                        <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                        <span class="text-sm">Gemini Pro</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-auto pt-6">
                        <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl border border-blue-200">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                <span class="text-blue-700 font-medium">Beneficios disponibles inmediatamente</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">Beca estudiantil</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                            La UNET ofrece becas estudiantiles para apoyar a estudiantes con necesidades económicas. 
                            Cubre matrícula, materiales de estudio y otros gastos educativos. 
                            Ademas cubre los requisitos académicos y socioeconómicos.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">Correo institucional</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                            Todos los estudiantes reciben correo institucional al inscribirse. 
                            Esencial para comunicación oficial y acceso a servicios académicos en línea. 
                            Revisar regularmente para anuncios importantes y oportunidades.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    @keyframes pulse-slow {
        0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; }
        50% { opacity: 0.5; }
    }
    .animate-pulse-slow {
        animation: pulse-slow 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .animation-delay-2000 {
        animation-delay: 2s;
    }
    .animation-delay-4000 {
        animation-delay: 4s;
    }
</style>